WEBVTT

00:04.080 --> 00:09.640
The 18th year of Longwu you promoted Xuan's largest land reform since the founding.

00:09.720 --> 00:13.480
A reform with Grand Tutor Xie Xuan as the core.

00:13.600 --> 00:16.200
Began implementation in Qingzhou.

00:17.040 --> 00:22.720
Princess, please go persuade the emperor even if it's Empress Xie's death anniversary he can't not eat.

00:23.520 --> 00:27.720
Father xunyang requests an audience yu'er.

00:28.200 --> 00:29.600
Come in.

00:40.720 --> 00:43.760
Father, don't be sad yu'er is with you.

00:46.240 --> 00:47.640
Good child.

00:48.320 --> 00:49.720
Good child.

01:17.160 --> 01:22.160
Father, Your Majesty ruolan's death anniversary no need to bow to me.

01:34.880 --> 01:36.547
Has the crown prince come?

01:37.680 --> 01:40.600
Your Majesty the crown prince.

01:41.840 --> 01:43.640
Probably has not come.

